      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3331,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3338,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WRITE touches: same services as A, but requests in a hot cell\nare matched in BATCHES every 2 s (best overall assignment,\nnot first-come grabs); riders without a driver wait for the\nnext round. A demand / supply counter per H3 cell sets the\nsurge multiplier; the estimate locks the surged price.\n\nREAD touches: surge (Redis) x route (Maps API, cached);\nride status + queue position from the SQL replica.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WRITE touches: same services as A, but requests in a hot cell\nare matched in BATCHES every 2 s (best overall assignment,\nnot first-come grabs); riders without a driver wait for the\nnext round. A demand / supply counter per H3 cell sets the\nsurge multiplier; the estimate locks the surged price.\n\nREAD touches: surge (Redis) x route (Maps API, cached);\nride status + queue position from the SQL replica.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
